==Battleground==
*30 [[Croco]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*15 [[Squire Rel]]s (300%) spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*15 [[Squire Rel]]s (300%) spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**20 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**2 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**8 [[Dagshund]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**4 [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is very similar to an early SoL stage. Most units work here, though it is recommended to wait until you at least beat EoC Chapter 2, and get all the treasures, as Chapter 3 is more difficult than this stage. [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)]] works wonders here, and having a 3 meatshield combo ([[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]], [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Boogie Cat]], and [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]]) along with [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] can also shred the Celebedoodles, Dachshunds, and Duche, while giving enough time for your Valkyrie to pound the Teacher Bear into submission.

